    in a way that suggests endorsement by Dexia Digi.
  - Scripture text itself, which is public domain (see OPEN-SOURCE.md).
    The Berean Standard Bible text used by Flockpath was dedicated
    to the public domain (CC0) by its translators, not by this
    project. An older sample pack still carries public-domain WEB
    text, also not by this project.
  - Hymn words, tunes, and settings, which are public domain in the
    US per item, verified in Hymn Desk, not by this project.
  - Study sources (commentaries, devotionals, dictionaries), which
    are public domain except the lexicon/interlinear data listed
    in OPEN-SOURCE.md as CC BY 4.0, with attribution there.
  - Third-party libraries, which keep their own licenses, listed
    in OPEN-SOURCE.md. All of them are free, open-source licenses
